# Aang's Iceberg: "When this enchantment enters, exile up to one other target nonland permanent until this enchantment
# leaves the battlefield." On turn 3 Bot1 taps Mox Pearl for the Iceberg's {W}. The trigger refuses Bot2's Island (a
# land) and the Iceberg itself ("other"), and takes Bot1's own tapped Mox Pearl (any nonland permanent: positive
# control). On turn 4 Bot2 destroys the Iceberg with Disenchant; the exiled Mox returns (CR 610.3) as a new object
# (CR 400.7), so it is untapped although it was tapped when it left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Mox Pearl
Aang's Iceberg
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Plains
Disenchant
Plains x2
Island x18

